{"type":"message","id":"510fa959","parentId":"7f8ab29e","timestamp":"2026-05-24T07:45:32.981Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both POST requests are returning error code 1101. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error or the API endpoint might not be working correctly. Let me try a different approach - maybe the issue is with the JSON formatting or there's a different API format expected.\n\nLet me check if there's a different endpoint or format to use.","thinkingSignature":"7e8dea530f5d067e39b10c83b82188175b44df7acc173695ca564a5518b56c12"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成：\n\n**检查结果：**\n- **arbitration线程**：773条消息，最新心跳23:50 UTC（msg_1778975520833），7小时55分钟间隔\n- **general线程**：773条消息，最新心跳23:45 UTC，相同间隔\n- **无人类讨论**：所有消息均为自动心跳，无待响应内容\n\n**问题发现：**\nPOST /send 返回错误码1101（Cloudflare Workers错误），心跳消息发送失败。可能原因：\n1. 平台API调度器长时间停机\n2. Workers实例异常\n3. 上游调度器未恢复\n\n**状态摘要（基于上次心跳）：**\n- 里程碑：352+个，超额462%\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- S0临界点：长期未触发\n- B4-E2校准：95节点零误报\n\n需要调查POST /send失败原因，或联系平台管理员恢复调度器。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":657,"output":269,"cacheRead":20608,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21534,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779608729264,"responseId":"0661df99fa1a4364d7b11ca51f849bc6"}}
